sequenceDiagram
    participant Farmer
    participant AI_Service as AI Analyzer (Django)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Customer
    
    Farmer->>AI_Service: Request Crop Suggestion (Soil Data)
    AI_Service-->>Farmer: Returns 'Rice' (RandomForest)
    
    Farmer->>AI_Service: Request Market Insights (Sales Data)
    AI_Service-->>Farmer: Returns Demand Forecast (LinearReg)
    
    Farmer->>DB: Lists 'Rice' for Sale
    
    Customer->>DB: Browses Marketplace
    Customer->>DB: Purchases 'Rice'
    
    Customer->>DB: Submits Review (5 Stars)
    DB-->>Farmer: Review Notification
